{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '12,22p;45,78p' tests/test_accounting_p03.py; rg -n 'MC28' docs/plans/accounting-mission-requirements.md; rg -n 'opening|observation|source|entity' docs/design/examples/debt.accdsl docs/design/examples/debt*.acc 2>/dev/null\"","aggregated_output":"\nROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]\nsys.path.insert(0, str(ROOT / 'scripts'))\nimport core0_ir_v1 as ir\nfrom core0_frontends_v1 import compile_source\nimport jsonschema\n\nOBSERVATIONS = []\nBASE = (ROOT / 'docs/design/fixtures/borrowing.acc').read_text()\nREASON = 'Fixed-rate proportion not disclosed'\nRENAMED = '''module FinancingStudy version \"2\";\ndef bindings(principal=100, renamed=False):\n    \"\"\"Explicit synthetic evidence, separately authored from source and expected IR.\"\"\"\n    p = F(principal); stamp = '2026-01-01T00:00:00Z'\n    book, symbol = ('Statutory', 'share') if renamed else ('Local', 'alpha')\n    names = ('fixed', 'floating') if renamed else ('allFixed', 'allFloating')\n    package_path = ROOT / 'docs/design/fixtures/demo-debt-package.json'\n    return ir.CompileBindings(\n        packages=[ir.PackageBinding('DemoDebt', '1', hashlib.sha256(package_path.read_bytes()).hexdigest(),\n            'DemoDebt', '2025-01-01', '2028-01-01', ['reset','accrue_and_pay','close','statements'],\n            ['builtin:Core0@1','DemoCalendar@1'], ['fixture:demo-debt-package.json'])],\n        readings=[ir.ReadingBinding('synthetic-note-7', f'Synthetic disclosed debt {p} USD; split undisclosed', p,\n            'USD', '2025-12-31', 'fixture:p03-synthetic', 'synthetic-2025', stamp, stamp,\n            'synthetic-author', stamp, 'Explicit synthetic acceptance, not human approval', stamp,\n            system_as_of=stamp, action='Accept')],\n        openings=[ir.OpeningBinding('after-2025-close', '2025-12-31',\n            {'Cash':p-5, 'Debt':-p, 'InterestExpense':0, 'Retained':5}, book=book)],\n        reports=[ir.ReportBinding('DemoDebt.statements.v1','DemoDebt.statements.v1',\n            'interest_operating','close',['accrue_and_pay'])],\n        assumptions=[ir.AssumptionBinding(k, 'Synthetic explicit '+k, information_cutoff=stamp,\n            valid_start='2026-01-01',valid_end='2027-01-01')\n            for k in ('alternative','constraint','contract-rate','scenario')],\n        admissions=[ir.SymbolAdmission(symbol,'synthetic-note-7',REASON,'synthetic-author',stamp)],\n        alternatives=[ir.AlternativeBinding(n,'synthetic-author',stamp,'Synthetic endpoint') for n in names],\n        calendar_id='DemoCalendar@1',calendar_name='Gregorian',horizon_start='2026-01-01',\n        horizon_end='2027-01-01',symbol_uncertainty='HistoricalFact',\n        entity_perimeter='Beta-only' if renamed else 'Acme-only')\n\n\ndef typed(principal=100, stress=F(7,100), renamed=False, arithmetic=False):\n    mod, ver, src, ent, book, opening, obs, sym, contract, a1, a0, scenario, report = (\n        ('FinancingStudy','2','disclosure','Beta','Statutory','carried','borrowing','share','facility',\n         'fixed','floating','shock','financials') if renamed else\n        ('BorrowingExample','1','note7','Acme','Local','after2025','debt','alpha','loans',\n         'allFixed','allFloating','rateShock','statements'))\n102:| MC28 | Connect the full design through complete synthetic and real disclosure cases. U1, U2, U3, D. | Supply a known-history synthetic company and a named annual/interim real package across multiple dates; trace representative notes through records, constraints, alternatives and all affected future statements. Add structural finance/sector cases before fixing the core types. | Reference cases delivered in Ch. 2: complete synthetic Northstar history/revision/forecast and named Apple annual/interim inventory, notes and conditional stress. Ch. 9 supplies sector/finance structures. Real-company full semantic closure and independent case annotation remain open; no complete Apple forecast is claimed. G4, G5, G7. Nine eight-year report sequences are now source-checked; report-wide semantic cases and executable oracles remain to be prepared. |\n141:MC28, MC30 and MC33–35 without closing semantic, accounting or forecast\n","exit_code":2,"status":"failed"}}
